[0.010814, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[H$ ounce-core\r\r\n"]
[0.210509, "o", "Ounce Core 0.7.0\r\n\r\nStart here:\r\n  ounce-core ui                     Check a program in the browser workbench (drop a .nro, compare engines)\r\n  ounce-core run-nro <file.nro>     Run a Switch homebrew program and print where it stopped\r\n  ounce-core run-elf <file>         Run a static AArch64 Linux program\r\n\r\nIf a run stops early, the output ends with the next step and how to report it.\r\nAll commands: ounce-core help\r\n"]
